# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# error <row> <L1|L2|Linf> <expected> <tolerance>: rows of
# postProcessing/manufacturedLeadFieldECGSummary_ECG.dat (norms over the
# samples).
# Reciprocity gap on Vm_h (relative to the largest |direct|) and on the exact
# Vm (absolute, exact potentials up to 1.45): zero to 1e-9.
error    leadField-direct_relative                  Linf  0               1e-9
error    leadFieldStatic-directStatic               Linf  0               1.4e-9
# Lead field and direct solve on the exact Vm against the exact potential
error    leadFieldStatic-exactCentroid_torsoLeftFar Linf  0               1e-9
error    leadFieldStatic-exactCentroid_nearLeft     Linf  0               1e-9
error    leadFieldStatic-exactCentroid_torsoRight   L2    0.0176705555    1.8e-07
error    leadFieldStatic-exactCentroid_nearRight    L2    0.0176705555    1.8e-07
